+//       `FOLD_AGAIN_WAIT`; and `retried exactly once` is nowhere in the
+//       contract.                                                  leg  (h)
+//   M6  the two other boot sims that drive the merge retry still pass on the
+//       changed rig. [#809, task 3] That is the SUITE's sentence, not a leg of
